(1) I agree with Leonid Levin.  There should be a more graceful way
to recover from crashes.  Checkpointing or autosaving would be nice.
Trapping the errors and making up-to-date saves would be nice.
Admittedly, this might make it easier to cheat, but it's only a game.

(1a) Since the nethack developers have not responded to my repeated
requests to implement (1), would someone please mail me a patch so
that I can make reusable cheating saves?  Something that works
under ultrix or Sunos would be nice.

